  "releaseNotes": "- Claude Code workspace documents (Docs/AppPatterns, CLAUDE.md) and the README follow the template line-up of 0.8.4 (six templates, all for the Cookie authentication host; the former \"EmptyAuth\" / \"PatternShowcaseAuth\" names and the advice to create the Visual Studio solution from a \"Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Cookie\" template are gone). The authentication / approval pattern documents refer to the actual sidebar titles of the Pattern Showcase (\"認証・権限/...\", \"承認/...\") and to the approval route master instead of the retired approval flow templates.\n- Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Designer 1.3.26.",
